00:24:19,800 --> 00:24:27,460
Daphne the founder of this project is also feeling the emotion of the moment.
该项目的创始人达芙妮也感受到了这一刻的情感。

219
00:24:27,460 --> 00:24:34,820
She's spent 50 years seeing orphans go back to the wild but that doesn't make
她花了50年时间让孤儿们重返自然，但这并不能让

220
00:24:34,820 --> 00:24:39,140
it any easier to say farewell to six little babies that she's helped nurture
她更容易地与那六个被她悉心培育的小婴儿说再见

221
00:24:39,140 --> 00:24:50,340
back to life. She knows the movies for the best but it's still hard to say goodbye.
重新焕发生机。她最懂电影，但说再见却依然艰难。

222
00:24:50,340 --> 00:24:55,860
It's a big wide world out there a dangerous one and they become like your
世界很大，也很危险，他们就像你的……

223
00:24:55,860 --> 00:25:01,140
children you know we get very emotional about it but of course it's just a
孩子们，你们知道，我们对此会非常情绪激动，但当然，这仅仅只是……

224
00:25:01,140 --> 00:25:10,060
reward. We'll be keeping in touch with them but we always share a few tears saying goodbye.
奖励。我们会与他们保持联系，但每次告别时都会流几滴眼泪。

225
00:25:10,060 --> 00:25:16,540
It's ugly to the little ones that we've had since day one. Like Wendy you know he's
从一开始就有那些小家伙们，实在令人难过。就像温迪那样，你知道他……

226
00:25:16,540 --> 00:25:19,180
very special.
非常特别。

227
00:25:19,180 --> 00:25:26,660
As the baby elephants settle down for the night everyone's feeling apprehensive
当小象们安歇过夜时，所有人都感到不安。

228
00:25:26,660 --> 00:25:37,380
about tomorrow's big move.
关于明天的大笔操作。

229
00:25:37,380 --> 00:25:42,820
It's 5.13 in the morning and today is the big day. It's the day that Wendy and the
现在是早上5点13分，今天是个重要的日子。是温迪的……

230
00:25:42,820 --> 00:25:47,460
elephants are going to be moved. This is the last time they'll ever be at the
大象将被迁移。这是它们最后一次出现在……

231
00:25:47,460 --> 00:25:52,580
nursery. Now there's a lot of activity going on so no doubt the elephants have
幼崽们。现在有很多活动在进行，所以毫无疑问，大象也察觉到了某些事情正在发生。只希望一切都能顺利进行吧。

232
00:25:52,580 --> 00:25:57,540
sensed that something is happening. Let's just hope it goes smoothly and fingers
感觉到有事情正在发生。只希望一切都能顺利进行，手指……

233
00:25:57,540 --> 00:26:02,140
crossed that tighter will go into the back of the truck.
那些被绑得更紧的东西会被扔进卡车的后部。

234
00:26:02,140 --> 00:26:09,620
The keepers are loading the elephants two by two. Wendy is one of the first to go in.
饲养员们正将大象两两地装进卡车里。温迪是第一个被装进卡车的人。

235
00:26:09,620 --> 00:26:24,620
She's very quiet almost as if she's resigned herself to what's happening.
她非常安静，仿佛已经接受了即将发生的事。

236
00:26:24,620 --> 00:26:37,620
Next it's Nepasha as always eagerly chasing his bottle of milk into the truck.
接下来是尼帕沙，他像往常一样急切地把那瓶牛奶装进卡车里。

237
00:26:37,620 --> 00:26:47,620
Last it's Titus turn so it's all hands on deck.
最后轮到提图斯了，于是所有人都开始忙碌起来。

238
00:26:47,620 --> 00:26:56,020
Edwin and the keepers gently convince him to go in. It's all gone far more smoothly
埃德温和那些看守人耐心地说服他进去。一切进行得比任何人预期的都要顺利得多。

239
00:26:56,020 --> 00:27:01,620
than anyone had dared to hope.
比任何人敢想的都要顺利。

240
00:27:01,620 --> 00:27:07,100
With six elephants safely on board and over 200 hot and dusty miles between us
六头大象安全被带上船后，我们之间还有200多英里的崎岖道路

241
00:27:07,100 --> 00:27:11,660
and the new release site it's time to hit the road.
新发布地点已经到了，是时候出发了。

242
00:27:11,660 --> 00:27:17,660
Daphne and her family bid a last fond farewell to the babies as we head on.
达芙妮和她的家人向那些婴儿道了最后的告别，然后我们便启程了。

243
00:27:17,660 --> 00:27:23,420
With keepers in the back of the trucks to keep the little Ellie's car we take to
卡车后面有护工在照看小艾莉的车。

244
00:27:23,420 --> 00:27:28,660
the busy main road out of my rope heading to Sarvo.
我们沿着繁忙的主路驶向萨沃。

245
00:27:36,660 --> 00:27:41,660
We can hear them. We can actually hear the elephants in the car.
我们可以听到它们的声音。实际上，在车里也能听到大象的声音。

246
00:27:41,660 --> 00:27:46,660
But it seems clear that we have a big problem.
但显然，我们面临了一个大问题。

247
00:27:46,660 --> 00:28:02,660
We've had to stop the truck because we've heard Peter himself shouting at us
我们不得不停下卡车，因为我们听到彼得亲自在对我们大喊大叫。

248
00:28:02,660 --> 00:28:07,660
and that's because the adults in the back of the truck are getting so agitated
原因是卡车后部的成年人变得非常激动。

249
00:28:07,660 --> 00:28:12,660
that they've begun to charge and that's putting people's life in danger.
他们开始充电，这危及了人们的生命。

250
00:28:12,660 --> 00:28:31,660
Oh my goodness, this is awful.
天哪，这太糟糕了。

251
00:28:33,660 --> 00:28:38,660
Tomorrow on Elephant Diaries how will our babies react to the loss of their playmates?
明天在《 Elephant Diaries》节目中，我们的宝宝们会对失去玩伴这一情况作何反应呢？

252
00:28:38,660 --> 00:28:42,660
In Sarvo it's all changed for Emily's herd.
在Sarvo里，艾米莉的群体情况都发生了改变。

253
00:28:42,660 --> 00:28:49,660
And with 200 miles still to go will everyone survive the journey to the new release site?
还有200英里的距离要走，大家都能顺利到达新栖息地吗？

254
00:28:49,660 --> 00:28:54,660
Well actually you can see that on Thursday at 345 on BBC2.
其实，你可以在周四上午3点45分在BBC2频道看到相关内容。
